    "traits": "Consumable Herb Uncommon",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: divine demesnes and ancient holy sites.\n\nGodsblood moss grows in deep red mats across stones that have borne a divine manifestation, saintly martyrdom or miracle of lasting power. Gold-flecked veins pulse slowly through each living patch, quickening when touched by a wounded creature. Temple healers preserve it between sheets of consecrated linen and press the prepared moss directly against the body, where it dissolves into warm light. You regain 6d6+15 Hit Points, stop all bleeding and reduce one Injury by 2.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
